24
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,131
Griffins have four legs.

25
00:00:38,168 --> 00:00:40,505
But wings make limbs five and

26
00:00:40,505 --> 00:00:41,196
six.

27
00:00:41,196 --> 00:00:42,168
Birds,

28
00:00:42,168 --> 00:00:43,843
bats and pterosaurs fly with their

29
00:00:43,843 --> 00:00:44,486
